                                                "sense_id": "42cc1347-0ea4-3012-9f9c-1aa43bf51b14",
                                                "text": "“I want to stay. I really want to stay here, and rebuild my house in this very spot, just to spite the Ruscists,” she said, using a neologism for ‘Russian fascists’ that has become widespread in Ukraine since the invasion."
